>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `add_simp_wrapper`

``` hol4
clasimpLib.add_simp_wrapper :
  simpLib.simpset -> thm list ->
  clasetLib.claset -> clasetLib.claset
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Adds assumption-aware full simplification as an unsafe classical wrapper.

`add_simp_wrapper ss controls cs` returns `cs` with a wrapper named
`"asm_full_simp_tac"`. Around an unsafe classical step, the wrapper offers
a changed full-simplification transition using `ss` and `controls`, followed
by the original step's transitions. The control list accepts the ordinary
simplifier markers, including `Excl`, `Cong`, and `SF`. Search can therefore
simplify at unsafe choice points without losing the unsimplified
alternatives.

The operation does not change `cs`, `ss`, or the global claset. Adding a
wrapper with the same name replaces the existing wrapper in the returned
claset.

Safe-only tactics do not consult unsafe wrappers. In particular, this
wrapper is inert under `CS_CLARIFY_TAC`.

### Failure

Construction does not fail. The installed simplification alternative is
absent when simplification leaves the goal unchanged.

### Example

``` hol4
val search_cs =
  clasimpLib.add_simp_wrapper
    (clasimpLib.clasimp_ss ())
    [markerLib.Excl "myTheory.expensive_rule"]
    (clasetLib.the_claset ());
```

